---
title: "Booking DB status and paid state"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: No booking
  s1: pending, unpaid
  s2: rejected, unpaid
  s3: cancelled, unpaid
  s4: accepted, unpaid
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: booker submits valid request
  s1 --> s2: authorized host rejects
  s2 --> s1: reschedule transaction cancels original and creates replacement
  s1 --> s3: save cancelled status
  s1 --> s4: save accepted status and references
  s2 --> s3: save cancelled status
  s2 --> s4: save accepted status and references
  s4 --> s1: reschedule transaction cancels original and creates replacement
  s3 --> s2: authorized host rejects
  s3 --> s1: reschedule transaction cancels original and creates replacement
  s4 --> s3: save cancelled status
  s3 --> s4: save accepted status and references
